:''Not to be confused with [[Li'l Bore]].''
'''Bore Jr.''' (ウリボーイ, ''Uribōi'', '''Uriboy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Bore]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]].

