==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Uribōi (ウリボーイ), is a portmanteau of 瓜坊 ''uribō'' (young wild boar) and ボーイ ''bōi'' (boy).
*His stolen motorbike and "the night of 35" in his Japanese description reference the song "[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yu88zx_--wE 15 no Yoru]" by [[wikipedia:Yutaka Ozaki|Yutaka Ozaki]]; one of the lyrics translates to "I race off on a stolen motorcycle..."
*Ironically, his base attack power is higher than that of any other [[Bore]] variant.
*He is the first enemy to have the [[Mini-Wave]] ability.
*He has the highest base DPS out of any [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy.

